From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Show each sleep stage share of total sleep

The sleep charts already list each stage's duration, but leave the relative
shares to mental arithmetic. Show the share next to the duration in the day and
week stage tiles.

- Divide light, deep and REM by the recorded asleep time, which includes
  sleep-any stages that the device did not break down further.
- Divide awake by time in bed (asleep + awake), so it is not compared with a
  denominator that excludes it.
- Compute weekly shares from the whole period's totals instead of averaging
  daily percentages.
- Add English, Simplified Chinese and Traditional Chinese strings.

This uses the existing sleep sessions; no additional device data or setting is
needed.
